     1	# Migrations
     2	
     3	We deploy with rolling restarts, so for a few minutes the previous release and the new one run
     4	against the same database. Every migration must work with both releases:
     5	
     6	- add columns as nullable or with a default; never add a NOT NULL column without one
     7	- never rename or drop a column in the release that stops using it; drop it one release later
     8	- backfills run as a separate job, never inside the migration

